Begin=\"48\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,48)\">Deut 28:48</ref>, <bdbheb>ָ֯ ם</bdbheb> - <ref ref=\"Josh 11:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,14)\">Josh 11:14</ref> (but read in all <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׁ</bdbheb>, as <ref ref=\"Josh 23:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,23,15)\">Josh 23:15</ref>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Deut 7:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,24)\">Deut 7:24</ref></sup></lookup>), <bdbheb>לַשְׁמִד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 23:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,23,11)\">Isa 23:11</ref>, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>annihilate, exterminate:</highlight> accusative of person or a people, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> or human person, <ref ref=\"Deut 1:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,27)\">Deut 1:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,22)\">Deut 2:22</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb> person), <ref ref=\"Deut 6:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,15)\">Deut 6:15</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מֵעַלפְּֿנֵי הָאֲרָמָה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 9:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,20)\">Deut 9:20</ref> + 16 t. Deuteronomy; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,12)\">Josh 7:12</ref> (accusative <bdbheb>הַחֵרֶם</bdbheb>; + <bdbheb>מִקִּרְבְּכֶם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Josh 9:24\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,24)\">Josh 9:24</ref> +4 t. Joshua (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink><sup><reflink>D</reflink></sup></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\